{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Surreal Journey in Our\u00a0<i>Dreadling</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of our little pink dreadling on its mission to uncover the enigmatic Monono.\u00a0 <i>Our</i>\u00a0<i>Dreadling</i> is a minimalist platformer with Metroidvania-style exploration, delivering a  blend of dark humor, introspective storytelling, and surreal environments.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Liminal:</strong> Delve deep into the bizarre world of the Liminal as you seek Monono.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uhhh... Strange Storytelling:</strong> Experience a narrative that invites players to piece together its hidden layers through dialogue and  visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Break up your journey with a variety of quirky  mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong>\u00a0A blend of unique story telling and tongue-in-cheek dialogue that keeps you entertained... or doesn't...\u00a0 if you're a SQUARE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist:</strong> Inspired by titles like <i>Undertale </i>and<i>\u00a0Buddy Simulator 1984</i>, <i>Our</i>\u00a0<i>Dreadling</i> combines simplicity, charm and a whole lot of love to bring a surreal world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.poster.avif?t=1759620286\" width=1600 height=946 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.webm?t=1759620286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.mp4?t=1759620286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Our\u00a0Dreadling</i>\u00a0Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our little pink Dreadling in this unforgettable journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow today to stay updated!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482370?t=1759620286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/2dea97a643a7cd6561e1efd5de267d8040e53fac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759620286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/2e6fb5c485fc0bbd96eea7d2e5908f6b44b04595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759620286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/2e6fb5c485fc0bbd96eea7d2e5908f6b44b04595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759620286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Surreal Journey in Our\u00a0<i>Dreadling</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of our little pink dreadling on its mission to uncover the enigmatic Monono.\u00a0 <i>Our</i>\u00a0<i>Dreadling</i> is a minimalist platformer with Metroidvania-style exploration, delivering a  blend of dark humor, introspective storytelling, and surreal environments.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Liminal:</strong> Delve deep into the bizarre world of the Liminal as you seek Monono.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uhhh... Strange Storytelling:</strong> Experience a narrative that invites players to piece together its hidden layers through dialogue and  visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Break up your journey with a variety of quirky  mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong>\u00a0A blend of unique story telling and tongue-in-cheek dialogue that keeps you entertained... or doesn't...\u00a0 if you're a SQUARE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist:</strong> Inspired by titles like <i>Undertale </i>and<i>\u00a0Buddy Simulator 1984</i>, <i>Our</i>\u00a0<i>Dreadling</i> combines simplicity, charm and a whole lot of love to bring a surreal world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.poster.avif?t=1759620286\" width=1600 height=946 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.webm?t=1759620286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.mp4?t=1759620286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Our\u00a0Dreadling</i>\u00a0Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our little pink Dreadling in this unforgettable journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow today to stay updated!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Panopticorp"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/0ca89c23636ca5996316a06335615adf605f31af/header.jpg?t=1759620286","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u201cTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \u2018AS IS\u2019, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.\u201d<br><br>\u00a9 2025 [EW Athletics llc]. All r